cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, its code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Dynamo replay of Harness Leaderboard agent traffic"
abstract: >-
  Every original trial of the Harness Leaderboard dataset as listed on
  2026-11-20 (240 runs, 69,923 replayable trials, 6,947,564 model calls),
  converted to agentic Mooncake v2 traces and replayed through NVIDIA Dynamo's
  simulator under four routers on B300 TP2 workers. In simulation, the default
  KV router prefills 26.6B tokens and misses a 2 s TTFT / 50 ms ITL SLA on 29
  runs; session affinity prefills 8.9B tokens and meets it on all 240. The
  timing is modeled, and no request ran on a GPU.
authors:
  - family-names: Gonzalez
    given-names: Leonardo
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kumanday/dynamo-agent-traffic"
url: "https://adaptivesystems.institute/publications/dynamo-agent-traffic/"
keywords:
  - NVIDIA Dynamo
  - LLM inference
  - KV cache
  - prefix caching
  - request routing
  - coding agents
  - trace replay
  - simulation
